{
  "id": "one",
  "name": "One Dark / One Light",
  "sources": [
    "Atom One Dark / One Light syntax themes (MIT): atom/atom packages/one-dark-syntax and one-light-syntax styles/colors.less (hue-1..hue-6-2, mono-1, mono-3)",
    "Go builtins: storage.type purple hue-3 (int, string), constant.language orange hue-6 (nil, true), support.function cyan hue-1 (len, make)",
    "Comments of the dark variant: #7F848E of One Dark Pro (Binaryify/OneDark-Pro, MIT), Atom's #5C6370 is too dim on IntelliJ's backgrounds",
    "Same colors as the One C# palette of idea-dotnet-support (csharpPalettes/one.json)"
